   "sourceHash": "8243c67ab752b1e67415011bcb44236b7912af337dc8a53b4db32ef434cdc047",
   "text": "可乘火车至帕拉卡德枢纽站（Palakkad Junction），或直接驾车前往本院（预约后我们会提供详细路线指引）。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'retreat' rendered as 本院 (our hospital) to keep clinical register; 'booking' rendered as 预约."
   ]
  },
  {
